                                "sense_id": "c4500dca-a366-3b0e-8204-e439cc46bc43",
                                "text": "Po troistym proszku przyszły jakieś odwary, […] próchno do zasypywnaia za pulchnych nóżek i rączek Laluski, potem korzeń fiołkowy na ząbki.",
                                "translation": "After the triple powder came some decoctions, […] powder to cover Laluska's chubby legs and hands, then violet root for the teeth.",
